Package: chess-club-manager
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk
Maintainer: Yahya <yahya@thga.de>
Description: Chess Club Tournament & Rating Manager (frontend)
 Desktop client for the Chess Club Manager REST API. Provides player
 and standings views, rating history, and forms to record games and
 register players. Talks to the API over HTTP; set CHESS_API_URL and
 CHESS_API_KEY to point it at a running backend.
